 bonus points, and think twice before swinging at a gold one, because those cost you.\n\nFOUR WAYS TO PLAY\n\nCLASSIC - Sixty seconds. The pace climbs the longer you last, so the final ten seconds are a blur.\n\nSURVIVAL - No clock. Three lives. The moles keep speeding up until you miss three, and you will.\n\nSEQUENCE - Watch the order they pop, then whack it back from memory. Starts easy. Does not stay easy.\n\nPRECISION - Fewer moles, but the window to hit each one keeps shrinking. Hit early for a perfect bonus.\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Moles pop up, you swing. MOLE WHACK is a physical arcade game for room scale play: knock the moles back down , build a streak for bonus points, and think twice before swinging at a gold ones. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mallet-memory-whack.vercel.app/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "B Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mallet-memory-whack.vercel.app/privacy.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1329822426871997"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "957608330681688"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "957608330681688"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1789885980, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "95760833